  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the contributions by scientists from developing countries to the Planet under Pressure Conference, London March 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To support the contributions by scientists from developing countries to the Planet under Pressure Conference, London March 2012 is a component of Strengthening the evidence base for the Rio+20 UN Conference on Sustainable Development reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;100,000. This project benefits South America, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
